{
  "slug": "vitals",
  "name": "Vitals",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Codebase vital signs — hotspot detection, ROI-ranked diagnosis, co-change coupling, knowledge risk, and AI provenance tracking",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill** and **3 hooks**.\n\n- **Skills** (1): `scan` (Deep codebase health analysis — identifies hotspots, reads the riskiest files, diagnoses root causes, and prescribes specific refactoring…)\n- **Hooks** (3): `PostToolUse`, `Stop`, `SessionEnd`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install vitals@claude-community` from `chopratejas/vitals`.",
